{"4033270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rosepine hotel", "steam_appid": 4033270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;</strong>Rosepine Hotel<strong>&quot; </strong>is a first-person horror game. The story revolves around Alex — the protagonist — and the source of his lingering nightmares: the Rosepine Hotel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returning to the hotel of his memories, the air is thick with the scent of damp wood. Photographs on the walls seem to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is filled with fragments of childhood memories — you still remember someone calling your name with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, those faded memories have turned into echoes, drifting endlessly through the halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Narrative Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the story hidden in the details, and face the fear within the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033270/extras/f2064f36ce305ce2756b82717a89a770.avif?t=1763557747\" width=1372 height=686 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not about what you see — it’s about what you believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033270/extras/35179b7157e5f1bf9b503280c4456509.avif?t=1763557747\" width=1536 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about <strong>memory, guilt, and forgiveness.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;</strong>Rosepine Hotel<strong>&quot; </strong>is a first-person horror game. The story revolves around Alex — the protagonist — and the source of his lingering nightmares: the Rosepine Hotel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Returning to the hotel of his memories, the air is thick with the scent of damp wood. Photographs on the walls seem to breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is filled with fragments of childhood memories — you still remember someone calling your name with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, those faded memories have turned into echoes, drifting endlessly through the halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Narrative Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the story hidden in the details, and face the fear within the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033270/extras/f2064f36ce305ce2756b82717a89a770.avif?t=1763557747\" width=1372 height=686 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not about what you see — it’s about what you believe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033270/extras/35179b7157e5f1bf9b503280c4456509.avif?t=1763557747\" width=1536 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about <strong>memory, guilt, and forgiveness.</strong></p>", "short_description": "I thought that hand was pulling me out of a nightmare and back into reality. Soon, I’ll realize—it only dragged me into another nightmare: “Rosepine Hotel”", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Ukrainian, Russian, Turkish, Japanese, Polish, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Vietnamese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033270/0d499b4f90945b4be97e55c1069927b053f5e